      "comment": "Vaselisa von Strivozha: Silver Court of Veneter",
      "content": "Vaselisa's court was, before the Pale Star's torch was lit, a haven comparable to Kitezhgrad. Fae of many clans praised the Lady of the Vila for banishing cold and easing pain. She was known in later songs as pure, benevolent and true, though the weapon text suggests that this reputation was partly her own work. Veneter stayed with House Strivozha, and after the Cataclysm fell to a Strivozha heir again.",
