      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Vaselisa von Strivozha: Alrekr Jarizleivich",
      "content": "A human general and war hero of the Miscislavli Alliance who routed Pale Star armies. He urged Miscislav not to slaughter the Water Imps and was stripped of rank; his wife and children were killed by the Blood Eagle. He asked Vaselisa for passage to Monomakh to surrender, and was killed by her; his death was presented as poisoning by Miscislav's spies.",
